	(text "LUXEON TX (L1T2) Package: 3.70 mm x 3.70 mm \n0.50 mm width x 3.30 mm height Anode / Cathode Pads\n1.30 mm width x 3.30 mm height Center Thermal Pad \n2.80 mm spacing Pad 1 to Pad 2 Center Pitch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
